# Active slice scope

When [`.cursor/active-slice`](../../.cursor/active-slice) exists and `SCOPE_OVERRIDE=false`:

- Work only on `SLICE_ID`, `MODULE_ID`, and `FEATURE_NAME`(s) listed there.
- Task authority: `docs/project-files/project-plan/slices/<SLICE_ID>-tasks.md`.
- Requirements authority: `docs/requirements/slices/<SLICE_ID>/` (or `docs/requirements/requirements.md` during template bootstrap).
- Code: `src/` pages, modules, and shared UI for that feature.
- Tests: canonical paths in `tests/` per `tests/SCAFFOLD.md`.

Do not edit other slices, unrelated modules, or platform files unless the human explicitly overrides scope in chat (`SCOPE_OVERRIDE=true` or a named exception).

Copy template: [`.cursor/active-slice.example`](../../.cursor/active-slice.example).
